# iOS App Store screenshots scaffold
#
# Required device sizes (App Store Connect 2026):
# - 6.7"  (iPhone 16 Pro Max / 15 Pro Max)         1290 x 2796 px
# - 6.1"  (iPhone 16 / 15)                         1179 x 2556 px
# - 5.5"  (iPhone 8 Plus, legacy fallback)         1242 x 2208 px
#
# No iPad sizes: app.config.ts sets supportsTablet: false.
#
# Replace this .keep file with the captured PNGs before submission.
# lat.md/how-to/submit-the-mobile-app.md carries this as a precondition no
# waiver covers.
